WEBVTT

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:33.910
Colors

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:33.950
Chu-chu-cabrilla?

00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:39.370
Chu-chu-cabrillas are exactly

00:01:33.950 --> 00:01:39.370
what we're lacking as keepers of the peace!

00:01:39.580 --> 00:01:42.370
Chu-chu-cabrilla... I want one, too!

00:01:42.370 --> 00:01:44.000
I second that motion.

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:49.120
I will obtain a chu-chu-cabrilla,

00:01:44.580 --> 00:01:49.120
and perfect the art of slaughter.

00:01:49.700 --> 00:01:50.910
Slaughter?

00:01:51.080 --> 00:01:53.120
Okay, I'll ask Mom to-

00:01:57.160 --> 00:01:58.410
Mom.

00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:00.370
Oh, no!

00:02:00.950 --> 00:02:03.120
What's wrong? What happened to your mom?

00:02:03.120 --> 00:02:05.620
Did her body peel off? You know, like "flop!"

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:08.330
What do you mean, "peel off"? That's scary, Kotoha!

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:12.200
No, my mom was born peeled. Just, like, "flop!"

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:13.950
She was not, and you know it!

00:02:15.370 --> 00:02:17.370
What did your mom say?

00:02:17.370 --> 00:02:20.000
All it says here is "oh, no."

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.080
But this...

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:26.910
is a call to action,

00:02:22.290 --> 00:02:26.910
for the keepers of the peace, Colors!

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:28.080
Leader!

00:02:28.080 --> 00:02:28.870
Right!

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:30.250
We'll go right away!

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:31.330
Right away!

00:02:31.330 --> 00:02:31.830
And save.

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:32.830
Okay!

00:02:31.830 --> 00:02:32.830
And save.

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:35.250
Time to go rescue Sat-chan's mom!

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:36.790
Yeah!

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:43.700
Moooommm!

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:44.540
Wait...

00:02:43.700 --> 00:02:44.540
Moooommm!

00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:45.200
Moooommm!

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:46.290
We're on our way!

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:47.870
Wait!

00:02:46.290 --> 00:02:47.870
We're on our way!

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:51.120
Ameyoko

00:02:51.120 --> 00:02:53.540
Kise Fruits

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:53.290
Mom, what's wrong?!

00:02:53.870 --> 00:02:56.200
Oh, Sat-chan. Welcome back.

00:02:56.370 --> 00:02:58.450
And hello, Koto-chan, Yui-chan.

00:02:58.450 --> 00:03:01.000
Did something happen, Sat-chan's Mom?

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.660
Yes, and it's just terrible!

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.290
Did you find a dead body?

00:03:05.290 --> 00:03:08.950
No, it's much worse than that.

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:12.250
Bargain Price

00:03:09.290 --> 00:03:10.120
See?

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:12.830
I have all these unsold bananas.

00:03:14.540 --> 00:03:15.790
Bananas?

00:03:15.790 --> 00:03:17.040
But they're so a-peeling.

00:03:18.580 --> 00:03:20.830
That wasn't funny.

00:03:21.540 --> 00:03:22.500
Yes it was.

00:03:22.500 --> 00:03:25.620
Mom! THAT's why you called us?

00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:28.450
You say it like it's not a big deal.

00:03:28.450 --> 00:03:34.000
Bargain Price

00:03:28.660 --> 00:03:32.580
But if these bananas don't get sold today, then...

00:03:32.580 --> 00:03:33.870
Then?

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:35.750
Then starting tonight,

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:38.040
we'll be eating bananas for

00:03:35.750 --> 00:03:38.040
breakfast, lunch, and dinner!

00:03:40.700 --> 00:03:42.750
That does sound bad.

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:44.410
Real bad.

00:03:44.410 --> 00:03:45.870
That being the case...

00:03:45.870 --> 00:03:49.580
I need you, Colors, to peddle these bananas for me.

00:03:49.580 --> 00:03:51.160
Awww!

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.500
If you succeed, you'll get a big reward.

00:03:54.790 --> 00:03:56.160
Reward?

00:03:57.580 --> 00:03:58.950
We'll do our best!

00:03:58.950 --> 00:04:00.950
Good. Nice and obedient.

00:04:01.580 --> 00:04:03.450
Put the money in here, okay?

00:04:04.450 --> 00:04:06.790
There are some small coins in there to use for change.

00:04:08.330 --> 00:04:09.750
You can count on us!

00:04:11.660 --> 00:04:14.200
Okay, let's get selling!

00:04:15.830 --> 00:04:17.950
Re-ward! Re-ward! 

00:04:17.950 --> 00:04:21.870
Re-ward! Re-ward! Re-ward! Re-ward!

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:23.120
Re-ward!

00:04:23.330 --> 00:04:26.330
But HOW do we sell them?

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:28.870
In matters like this,

00:04:26.540 --> 00:04:28.870
the first move will make or break you.

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:31.370
You find a mark and reel him in.

00:04:32.000 --> 00:04:34.660
Kotoha, that sounded so cool.

00:04:35.660 --> 00:04:37.540
I just had an idea!

00:04:39.040 --> 00:04:40.290
Pops!

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:42.620
Pops, are you in there?

00:04:42.620 --> 00:04:43.950
Pops!

00:04:46.080 --> 00:04:47.660
Hey, Colors!

00:04:47.910 --> 00:04:49.910
You're as spirited as ever!

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:52.620
Pops, want a banana?

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:55.290
Hm? May I?

00:05:02.500 --> 00:05:05.410
Your family's fruits are the cream of the crop, Sat-chan!

00:05:05.830 --> 00:05:07.250
Thanks.

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:09.950
We're selling those. Gimme money.

00:05:09.950 --> 00:05:11.700
It was a trap?!

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:13.750
I see.

00:05:14.330 --> 00:05:16.500
Three meals of bananas, eh?

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:18.290
Then I guess I have no choice.

00:05:18.660 --> 00:05:20.250
I'll buy a bunch.

00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:21.700
Thanks for doing business!

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:26.250
You should buy the ones we're eating, too.

00:05:28.080 --> 00:05:30.450
There's no beating you girls, is there?

00:05:31.160 --> 00:05:34.200
Okay, one more bunch to include those bananas.

00:05:35.370 --> 00:05:36.750
Thanks for your business!

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:39.000
Mission accomplished.

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:41.250
And we're gonna keep selling 'em, just like that!

00:05:41.250 --> 00:05:42.500
See you later, Pops!

00:05:42.660 --> 00:05:43.450
Yeah!

00:05:58.540 --> 00:06:00.040
Thanks for doing business!

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:00.950
Thanks

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:00.950
for doing

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:00.950
business!

00:06:01.290 --> 00:06:02.370
Excuse me!

00:06:02.370 --> 00:06:04.620
Would anyone like a banana?

00:06:05.200 --> 00:06:07.450
How about a banana?

00:06:07.580 --> 00:06:10.160
A banana... please...

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:12.870
Please buy a banana.

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:15.290
If I can't sell these bananas...

00:06:15.290 --> 00:06:19.370
Sat-chan will be forced to eat only bananas!

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:31.250
I don't really get it,

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:31.250
but it sounds pretty bad, I guess...

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:33.080
Why don't we buy some?

00:06:34.950 --> 00:06:37.370
Thank you so much.

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:41.540
A prayer

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:41.540
for safety

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:41.540
A prayer

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:41.540
for safety

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:41.580
If you don't want to get in an accident,

00:06:38.370 --> 00:06:41.580
you better buy these.

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:43.000
What?

00:06:41.580 --> 00:06:43.000
Stop right there! Buy our bananas!

00:06:43.000 --> 00:06:44.040
Stop right there! Buy our bananas!

00:06:44.160 --> 00:06:45.700
Hold it right there!

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:50.410
Who said you could do business

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:50.410
on our turf, you little twerps?

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:56.540
If you don't deflate those swelled heads of yours,

00:06:52.660 --> 00:06:56.540
you're gonna get hurt!

00:06:58.080 --> 00:06:59.830
You wanna piece of this, punk?!

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:00.750
Slice!

00:07:03.250 --> 00:07:05.330
Y-you got me!

00:07:05.330 --> 00:07:06.000
Yeah!

00:07:06.620 --> 00:07:07.580
You little-

00:07:08.620 --> 00:07:09.700
Bang! Bang!

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:13.910
Yay!

00:07:15.330 --> 00:07:16.870
Hey, these are pretty good.

00:07:17.120 --> 00:07:19.160
Let's take 'em back to the shop.

00:07:19.160 --> 00:07:19.830
Huh?

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:21.330
This is your tombstone!

00:07:22.870 --> 00:07:24.500
Just one more bunch!

00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.080
Just one more bunch!

00:07:27.410 --> 00:07:28.750
What do we do?

00:07:29.080 --> 00:07:31.750
If we eat it, it will no longer exist.

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:34.620
The idea is a-peeling...

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:39.910
Huh?

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:42.160
Well, anyway...

00:07:42.160 --> 00:07:43.700
What do we do?

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:44.450
Huh?

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:47.540
I got it!

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:50.700
There's only one person

00:07:47.540 --> 00:07:50.700
