00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:54.250
Colors, champions of justice, will sell it to our enemy!

00:07:54.250 --> 00:07:56.660
Zoo Front Police Box

00:07:54.700 --> 00:07:56.040
Saito!

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:58.830
No. I don't want any.

00:07:58.830 --> 00:08:00.450
