00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:18.040
Or do you mean to tell me that selling bananas

00:08:12.500 --> 00:08:18.040
will somehow bring peace to the city?

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:21.120
I'm busy ACTUALLY keeping the peace here.

00:08:21.370 --> 00:08:23.370
I don't have time for your games.

00:08:23.580 --> 00:08:25.790
Leave. Me. Alone.

00:08:26.250 --> 00:08:28.910
Get the picture? Then get lost.

00:08:29.870 --> 00:08:32.330
Excuse me, Officer.

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:35.790
I would like to get some directions.

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:38.160
Sure. Where are you going?

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:41.750
Star... buccaneer, or whatever it's called?

00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:47.120
Do you mean the one right in front of us, perhaps?

00:08:49.330 --> 00:08:51.450
Kotoha? What happened?

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:54.790
My tummy. I was kicked...

00:08:56.370 --> 00:08:57.750
...by that man.

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:58.700
Huh?

00:08:58.700 --> 00:09:01.200
Be careful, Ma'am.

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:05.660
It's police brutality.

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:05.660
He would even kick a small child.

00:09:06.790 --> 00:09:08.540
Where did you come up with THAT, dammit?!

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:15.620
Please, give me back the eyes you gouged out, Officer!

00:09:15.620 --> 00:09:17.040
You, too, blockhead?!

00:09:17.200 --> 00:09:20.330
My-my bottom's split in two!

00:09:20.330 --> 00:09:22.330
And you're a terrible liar!

00:09:22.330 --> 00:09:24.290
Ugh, give me a break.

00:09:26.750 --> 00:09:29.410
Wh-what a dreadful police officer.

00:09:29.410 --> 00:09:31.370
Is everyone that gullible at your age?!

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:33.580
My tummy!

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:33.580
My eyes!

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:33.580
M-my bottom...

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:33.580
H-huh?! I-it's not like that!

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:35.250
It's a curse! The fox's curse!

00:09:33.580 --> 00:09:35.250
H-huh?! I-it's not like that!

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:36.410
It's a curse! The fox's curse!

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:40.200
Okay, I get it! I get it!

00:09:37.080 --> 00:09:40.200
I just need to buy your stupid bananas, right?!

00:09:44.540 --> 00:09:46.790
Thank you, Saito-san!

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:48.040
Thanks for doing business!

00:09:48.540 --> 00:09:51.040
You should have just bought them to begin with.

00:09:51.040 --> 00:09:52.040
Shut up!

00:09:53.790 --> 00:09:55.250
Mom!

00:09:55.250 --> 00:09:57.250
Oh, welcome back!

00:09:57.500 --> 00:09:58.830
We sold all of them!

00:09:59.200 --> 00:10:02.450
Good work, girls. Thanks.

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:06.750
For your reward, I got you something

00:10:02.870 --> 00:10:06.750
you've all been wanting.

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:09.950
We've all been wanting?

00:10:09.950 --> 00:10:11.200
You mean...?

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:12.870
Is it...?

00:10:15.870 --> 00:10:18.580
Chu-chu-cabrillas!

00:10:23.700 --> 00:10:25.410
I will sever flesh and bone!

00:10:27.200 --> 00:10:30.250
Chu-chu-cabrillas are so cute!

00:10:30.370 --> 00:10:32.200
Thanks, Mom!

00:10:32.200 --> 00:10:35.160
You're welcome. You girls earned them!

00:10:36.290 --> 00:10:38.370
Let's go vanquish Saito again!

00:10:38.370 --> 00:10:39.160
Yeah!

00:10:40.040 --> 00:10:41.950
Next time, he will breathe his last.

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:44.870
Watch out for cars!

00:10:50.500 --> 00:10:51.700
Those things are creepy.

00:11:02.000 --> 00:11:04.950
It's been a long time since I've bought a banana.

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:13.500
Is that any good?

00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:15.250
It's alright.

00:11:15.250 --> 00:11:16.330
I see.

00:11:17.620 --> 00:11:19.120
You're not getting any.

00:11:19.120 --> 00:11:20.200
I don't want any.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:24.290
Saito!

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:24.950
Choo-choo! Choo-choo! Choo-choo!

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:26.040
Something's coming.

00:11:24.950 --> 00:11:26.040
Choo-choo! Choo-choo! Choo-choo!

00:11:26.040 --> 00:11:27.450
Choo-choo! Choo-choo! Choo-choo!

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.580
Choo-choo!

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:31.700
Darnit, Saito! Open that door!

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:32.580
Get out here!

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:34.580
Please open the door!

00:11:34.830 --> 00:11:37.410
Chu-chu-cabrillas are gonna get you!

00:11:37.410 --> 00:11:38.750
Open up, or else.

00:11:38.750 --> 00:11:40.830
If he does open up, we'll still get him.

00:11:40.830 --> 00:11:42.290
Open up, or else.

00:11:42.290 --> 00:11:45.080
Open up or we'll wait here forever!

00:11:45.080 --> 00:11:47.250
Oh! But that won't work, either!

00:11:47.250 --> 00:11:49.370
Please open the door!

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:58.080
Cut the wire that's the same color

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:58.080
as the "ey" in the middle.

00:11:56.410 --> 00:11:58.080
Hint: Find it on Shopping Street

00:11:57.910 --> 00:11:59.830
I made a bomb.

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:00.700
Cut the wire that's the same color

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:00.700
as the "ey" in the middle.

00:11:58.080 --> 00:12:00.700
Hint: Find it on Shopping Street

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:06.330
If you don't defuse it, this town will go kaboom.

00:12:06.700 --> 00:12:08.870
What will you do, Colors?

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:11.080
A bomb.

00:12:11.080 --> 00:12:12.500
A case!

00:12:12.830 --> 00:12:14.000
Pops...

00:12:16.120 --> 00:12:17.950
This sounds like fun!

00:12:17.950 --> 00:12:19.040
I know, right?

00:12:21.040 --> 00:12:23.750
Okay! Time for a strategy meeting!

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:24.830
Yeah!

00:12:25.410 --> 00:12:30.040
Colors

00:12:26.750 --> 00:12:30.080
Let's see. To stop the bomb...

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:35.660
there's a red wire and a blue wire,

00:12:30.290 --> 00:12:35.660
and we have to cut the right one.

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:42.580
Cut the wire that's the same color

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:42.580
as the "ey" in the middle.

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:42.580
Hint: Find it on Shopping Street

00:12:35.660 --> 00:12:42.580
Blue

00:12:35.670 --> 00:12:42.580
Red

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:39.700
"Cut the wire that's the same color

00:12:36.540 --> 00:12:39.700
as the eye in the middle.

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:42.620
Hint: Find it on Shopping Street."

00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:45.000
Shopping Street.

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:51.580
Cut the wire that's the

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:51.580
same color as the eye

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:51.580
in the middle.

00:12:44.370 --> 00:12:51.580
Shopping Street

00:12:45.200 --> 00:12:49.040
