00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:04.000
But people only have a right and a left eye.

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:08.540
Maybe it means something in the middle

00:13:05.000 --> 00:13:08.540
of the products lined up on the shelves.

00:13:09.200 --> 00:13:11.500
Products? At what store?

00:13:12.620 --> 00:13:13.620
The eyeball store.

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:17.120
That would be a scary store!

00:13:13.790 --> 00:13:17.120
There's no store like that!

00:13:17.330 --> 00:13:20.000
No. I can think of one place there might be.

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:22.120
The Underground.

00:13:24.620 --> 00:13:25.950
