00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:50.000
Y-yeah, there are a lot of smells.

00:13:50.540 --> 00:13:52.450
Okay, let's split up and search!

00:13:52.450 --> 00:13:53.450
Yeah!

00:13:53.450 --> 00:13:54.580
Very well!

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:56.120
Okay!

00:13:56.120 --> 00:13:58.500
Operation: Find the Middle Eye!

00:14:00.290 --> 00:14:01.580
Here I go!

00:14:01.790 --> 00:14:03.250
Hey, man!

00:14:03.250 --> 00:14:04.660
Do you sell eyeballs?

00:14:05.700 --> 00:14:08.200
Eyeballs? Like fish eyes?

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:10.830
No one sells just the eyeballs.

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:12.500
Then what about poop?

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:13.830
Or poop.

00:14:14.080 --> 00:14:15.330
Well, fine!

00:14:17.750 --> 00:14:20.250
Hey, man! You sell poop, right?

00:14:20.500 --> 00:14:21.620
Can't say I do.

00:14:21.950 --> 00:14:23.660
Not even dried poop?

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:25.040
Nope.

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:29.000
Oh, no. Sat-chan's gonna get yelled at again.

00:14:25.500 --> 00:14:29.000
Aww. Then what shop DOES sell poop?

00:14:29.000 --> 00:14:29.500
Aww. Then what shop DOES sell poop?

00:14:29.500 --> 00:14:30.000
We're not even looking for poop.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:31.950
We're not even looking for poop.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:31.950
Hey! Can I ask you a question?

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:32.910
Hey! Can I ask you a question?

00:14:33.160 --> 00:14:33.660
Somebody!

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:34.250
Oh! Wait, Kotoha!

00:14:33.660 --> 00:14:34.250
Somebody!

00:14:34.250 --> 00:14:35.000
Oh! Wait, Kotoha!

00:14:35.000 --> 00:14:36.330
Let's look together!

00:14:37.950 --> 00:14:39.000
Okay...

00:14:39.000 --> 00:14:40.450
Chicken Legs

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:47.870
Duck

00:14:43.450 --> 00:14:47.870
Sliced Pigs' Feet

00:14:43.460 --> 00:14:47.870
Pigs' Ears & Tails

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:49.870
Oh. You're scared.

00:14:49.870 --> 00:14:52.370
I-I'm not scared! I'm just normal!

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:58.120
Another big pile of bananas.

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:01.500
I bet the people who live here

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:01.500
will be eating bananas for all three meals.

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:05.700
Now see here, you can't go around

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:05.700
saying "poop" everywhere.

00:15:05.700 --> 00:15:06.830
Why not?

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:08.790
Look at that meat!

00:15:08.790 --> 00:15:11.410
When it was alive, it was pooping!

00:15:11.790 --> 00:15:13.700
Well, that's true, but...

00:15:13.700 --> 00:15:14.540
You see?

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:18.250
And eventually, that meat will BE poop!

00:15:18.660 --> 00:15:21.410
In the end, we'll ALL be poop.

00:15:22.250 --> 00:15:24.040
That's very philosophical.

00:15:25.330 --> 00:15:28.870
Our final destination... is nothing but poop.

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:35.290
Yeah.

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:37.870
Bye!

00:15:38.580 --> 00:15:39.540
Bye...

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:44.250
They say that once a softshell turtle bites down,

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:44.250
it never lets go.

00:15:44.250 --> 00:15:46.910
What? This is dangerous!

00:15:54.450 --> 00:15:56.660
This one's no good. Let's go.

00:15:56.660 --> 00:15:58.500
Hey, wait, Kotoha!

00:15:59.290 --> 00:16:03.580
I'm telling you, in the end, we'll ALL end up as poop!

00:16:04.120 --> 00:16:06.120
That's very philosophical.

00:16:06.330 --> 00:16:08.660
What do you think these bones are from?

00:16:09.450 --> 00:16:10.410
Humans.

00:16:10.410 --> 00:16:11.580
What?

00:16:11.750 --> 00:16:14.950
I bet Pops' bones look a lot like this.

00:16:15.330 --> 00:16:17.370
Y-you think so?

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:20.160
Yui! Koto-chan!

00:16:20.450 --> 00:16:22.910
Sat-chan! Did you find the eyeballs?

00:16:22.910 --> 00:16:23.660
Look!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:26.040
Escalator     Elevator     Restrooms

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.580
It's all over there!

00:16:34.040 --> 00:16:37.290
Nothing. Nobody's selling eyeballs.

00:16:37.290 --> 00:16:39.120
And it's such a suspicious place, too.

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:41.790
I bet they only show them to their regular customers.

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:44.580
Is that how it is?

00:16:48.660 --> 00:16:49.540
Huh?

00:16:49.540 --> 00:16:50.660
Nono-chan?

00:16:51.830 --> 00:16:54.830
You saw me...

00:16:55.330 --> 00:16:57.120
Whatcha doing, Nono-chan?

00:16:59.250 --> 00:17:01.000
You want to know what I'm doing?

00:17:01.330 --> 00:17:04.700
I can't tell you now; it's a top secret mission.

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:07.040
Wow, top secret?

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:12.830
But soon, the day may come

00:17:07.500 --> 00:17:12.830
when I ask you Colors for help.

00:17:13.410 --> 00:17:15.250
When it does, we'll talk.

00:17:18.000 --> 00:17:19.200
I know! 

00:17:19.200 --> 00:17:21.200
Are YOU a regular here, Nonoka?

00:17:21.200 --> 00:17:24.330
Huh? Well, I do come by every so often.

00:17:24.540 --> 00:17:26.080
Where's the eyeball shop?

00:17:26.080 --> 00:17:27.450
Eyeball shop?!

00:17:30.750 --> 00:17:37.540
Ueda Cash Loans

00:17:31.950 --> 00:17:35.120
Oh, okay. And now you're looking for eyes?

00:17:36.580 --> 00:17:38.000
How do we do it?

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:42.200
But as far as I know,

00:17:38.000 --> 00:17:42.200
there aren't any in the Underground.

00:17:42.200 --> 00:17:43.580
Aww.

00:17:43.790 --> 00:17:46.540
Do you know of anything else, Nonoka?

00:17:46.910 --> 00:17:48.120
Eyes, huh?

00:17:48.660 --> 00:17:49.700
Eyes...

00:17:52.040 --> 00:17:55.000
This is something my teacher told me.

00:17:55.410 --> 00:17:57.500
People only see what they want to see.

00:17:57.910 --> 00:18:01.250
Some things are invisible even though they are visible.

00:17:58.950 --> 00:18:00.290
No Entry

00:18:03.790 --> 00:18:05.540
I don't get it.

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:08.000
What are you talking about, Nonoka?

00:18:08.200 --> 00:18:11.700
I'm saying you can't let the eyes deceive you.

00:18:12.540 --> 00:18:14.870
Eyes... Deceive.

00:18:16.410 --> 00:18:19.700
Visible, but invisible.

00:18:20.200 --> 00:18:22.540
In the middle of Ameyoko...

00:18:22.910 --> 00:18:23.950
Eye.

00:18:28.500 --> 00:18:29.660
Of course!

00:18:31.160 --> 00:18:32.290
This is it!

00:18:34.700 --> 00:18:35.950
It's not safe up there!

00:18:37.250 --> 00:18:38.620
But I'll get a picture.

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:53.910
Ameyoko

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:47.790
I've beat this game!

00:18:48.410 --> 00:18:51.040
The "ey" in the middle is red!

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:53.540
We cut the red wire!

00:18:55.410 --> 00:18:57.080
So THAT's what it meant!

00:18:57.250 --> 00:19:00.410
You're right! There's an "ey" 

00:18:57.250 --> 00:19:00.410
in the middle of the sign!

00:19:01.120 --> 00:19:03.080
Hey! What do you think you're doing?!

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:04.540
Oh. Saito-san.

00:19:04.540 --> 00:19:07.000
Am EY oko

00:19:08.830 --> 00:19:09.830
Pops!

00:19:09.830 --> 00:19:11.200
We beat your game.

00:19:12.080 --> 00:19:13.830
That's my Colors.

00:19:13.830 --> 00:19:16.040
You saved the town again.

00:19:16.540 --> 00:19:18.700
Really? Yay!

00:19:19.250 --> 00:19:22.000
That was pretty fun, Pops!

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:28.120
But if we can carry the bomb around, we could've

00:19:22.620 --> 00:19:28.120
just saved the day by dumping it in the pond.

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:30.950
Next time, you should set it up

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:30.950
in an art museum or somewhere.

00:19:30.950 --> 00:19:32.500
Oh, good idea.

00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:34.120
Don't listen to them!

00:19:34.370 --> 00:19:37.790
Could you not play games that are going to be

00:19:34.370 --> 00:19:37.790
a nuisance to everybody?

00:19:37.790 --> 00:19:39.370
It's for the children.

00:19:39.660 --> 00:19:42.870
I don't care if it's a nuisance to YOU.

00:19:42.870 --> 00:19:45.080
You should! You should be annoyed, too!

00:19:45.080 --> 00:19:47.700
Hey, now, no fighting. 

00:19:47.700 --> 00:19:49.830
Call us again when you're in a pinch!

00:19:49.950 --> 00:19:53.580
We are Colors! We protect this town!

00:19:53.830 --> 00:19:55.330
None of your poses match.

00:19:55.330 --> 00:19:56.450
Fare thee well!

00:20:01.290 --> 00:20:03.000
Hey, Colors!

00:20:03.870 --> 00:20:05.580
Do you like this town?

00:20:33.160 --> 00:20:34.750
Not one bit!

00:20:38.080 --> 00:20:39.250
Not a bit?

00:20:43.250 --> 00:20:44.830
Hey, what should we do next?

00:20:44.830 --> 00:20:45.950
Make a poop bomb!

00:20:45.950 --> 00:20:47.500
We'll blow up everything.

00:22:19.160 --> 00:22:22.870
So if you cut the wrong wire, will this really explode?

00:22:23.580 --> 00:22:25.370
Of course not.

00:22:25.370 --> 00:22:27.790
Blue

00:22:25.370 --> 00:22:27.790
Red

00:22:25.580 --> 00:22:27.830
But if you cut the blue wire...

00:22:30.040 --> 00:22:30.660
Ha!

00:22:34.160 --> 00:22:36.160
It shoots stink juice!

00:22:37.410 --> 00:22:39.660
Gross!

00:22:41.580 --> 00:22:45.540
Are you ready? We're having another

00:22:41.580 --> 00:22:45.540
Colors Evaluation Meeting!

00:22:45.540 --> 00:22:48.330
Now each one of us will say something

00:22:45.540 --> 00:22:48.330
we could have done better.

00:22:48.330 --> 00:22:50.040
You're getting bossy.

00:22:50.040 --> 00:22:51.540
Yeah. That's our leader!

00:22:51.540 --> 00:22:54.120
Alright, we'll start with you, Sat-chan. Go ahead.

00:22:54.120 --> 00:22:57.160
It was great that we got chu-chu-cabrillas!

00:22:57.160 --> 00:23:00.000
But they sure were hot!

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:01.540
Yes, good point.

00:23:01.540 --> 00:23:04.330
Chu-chu-cabrillas ARE hot in the summer.

00:23:04.500 --> 00:23:09.750
Let's wait until it's a little cooler before the

00:23:04.500 --> 00:23:09.750
chu-chu-cabrillas defeat Saito again!

00:23:09.750 --> 00:23:11.410
Yeah. Let's do that!

00:23:11.700 --> 00:23:13.410
Okay, what about you, Kotoha?

00:23:13.410 --> 00:23:17.870
I realize that I overdid it a little

00:23:13.410 --> 00:23:17.870
when I got on top of the Ameyoko sign.

00:23:17.870 --> 00:23:19.660
That WAS dangerous. 

00:23:19.660 --> 00:23:21.700
Don't try that at home, kids!

00:23:21.700 --> 00:23:25.040
Well, I doubt any kids at home

00:23:21.700 --> 00:23:25.040
have the guts to copy me.

00:23:25.040 --> 00:23:26.700
Don't say that!

00:23:26.700 --> 00:23:29.080
Don't try it at home, okay, kids?

00:23:30.160 --> 00:23:32.580
So what are we going to do next episode?

00:23:32.580 --> 00:23:34.200
Yes! Next episode...

00:23:34.410 --> 00:23:35.950
I'm going to dance!

00:23:36.410 --> 00:23:37.830
And that's supposed to be interesting?

00:23:37.830 --> 00:23:40.540
Come on, you can't say those things!
